rue\" data-tab=\"1\" role=\"tab\" tabindex=\"0\" aria-controls=\"popis-aplikace-tab\" aria-expanded=\"false\">\n                            \n                            \n                            \n                                                            <span class=\"eael-tab-title title-after-icon\" >Popis aplikace<\/span>                                                    <\/li>\n                                            <li id=\"ramanova-spektroskopie\" class=\"inactive eael-tab-item-trigger eael-tab-nav-item\" aria-selected=\"false\" data-tab=\"2\" role=\"tab\" tabindex=\"-1\" aria-controls=\"ramanova-spektroskopie-tab\" aria-expanded=\"false\">\n                            \n                            \n                            \n                                                            <span class=\"eael-tab-title title-after-icon\" >Ramanova spektroskopie<\/span>                                                    <\/li>\n                                            <li id=\"ft-ir-spektroskopie\" class=\"inactive eael-tab-item-trigger eael-tab-nav-item\" aria-selected=\"false\" data-tab=\"3\" role=\"tab\" tabindex=\"-1\" aria-controls=\"ft-ir-spektroskopie-tab\" aria-expanded=\"false\">\n                            \n                            \n                            \n                                                            <span class=\"eael-tab-title title-after-icon\" >FT-IR spektroskopie<\/span>                                                    <\/li>\n                                    <\/ul>\n            <\/div>\n            \n            <div class=\"eael-tabs-content\">\n\t\t        \n                    <div id=\"popis-aplikace-tab\" class=\"clearfix eael-tab-content-item inactive\" data-title-link=\"popis-aplikace-tab\">\n\t\t\t\t        <p><strong>Ramanova spektroskopie<\/strong> poskytuje informace o vzorku na molekul\u00e1rn\u00ed \u00farovni, co\u017e lze s\u00a0v\u00fdhodou pou\u017e\u00edt p\u0159i anal\u00fdze r\u016fzn\u00fdch druh\u016f polyethylenu. Tato metoda nevy\u017eaduje t\u00e9m\u011b\u0159 \u017e\u00e1dnou \u00fapravu vzork\u016f, je<strong> rychl\u00e1, nedestruktivn\u00ed<\/strong> a pomoc\u00ed programu <a href=\"https:\/\/nicoletcz.cz\/aplikacni-podpora\/software\/tq-analyst-9\/\"><strong>TQ Analyst<\/strong><\/a> je mo\u017en\u00e9 prov\u00e1d\u011bt i kvantitativn\u00ed m\u011b\u0159en\u00ed na m\u00edru.<\/p><p>Polyetylen (PE) je v\u00a0sou\u010dasn\u00e9 dob\u011b jedn\u00edm z\u00a0nejv\u00edce vyr\u00e1b\u011bn\u00fdch plast\u016f na sv\u011bt\u011b. Podle hustoty se d\u011bl\u00ed na n\u00edzkohustotn\u00ed (LDPE) a vysokohustotn\u00ed (HDPE) polyetylen, p\u0159i\u010dem\u017e ty maj\u00ed z\u00e1sadn\u011b odli\u0161n\u00e9 fyzik\u00e1ln\u00ed, chemick\u00e9 a mechanick\u00e9 vlastnosti, a proto se li\u0161\u00ed tak\u00e9 zp\u016fsob jejich pou\u017e\u00edv\u00e1n\u00ed. Zat\u00edmco HDPE se vyu\u017e\u00edv\u00e1 zejm\u00e9na pro v\u00fdrobu r\u016fzn\u00fdch n\u00e1dob a trubek, LDPE je v\u00fdchoz\u00ed surovinou pro v\u00fdrobu s\u00e1\u010dk\u016f a podobn\u00fdch obal\u016f.<\/p><figure id=\"attachment_9202\" aria-describedby=\"caption-attachment-9202\" style=\"width: 800px\" class=\"wp-caption aligncenter\"><img fetchpriority=\"high\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"wp-image-9202 size-large\" src=\"https:\/\/nicoletcz.cz\/app\/uploads\/2021\/10\/db28058a-1024x436.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"800\" height=\"341\" srcset=\"https:\/\/nicoletcz.cz\/app\/uploads\/2021\/10\/db28058a-1024x436.png 1024w, https:\/\/nicoletcz.cz\/app\/uploads\/2021\/10\/db28058a-300x128.png 300w, https:\/\/nicoletcz.cz\/app\/uploads\/2021\/10\/db28058a-768x327.png 768w, https:\/\/nicoletcz.cz\/app\/uploads\/2021\/10\/db28058a-1536x654.png 1536w, https:\/\/nicoletcz.cz\/app\/uploads\/2021\/10\/db28058a.png 1920w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 800px) 100vw, 800px\" \/><figcaption id=\"caption-attachment-9202\" class=\"wp-caption-text\">Ramanova spektra jednotliv\u00fdch typ\u016f PE a spektr\u00e1ln\u00ed regiony typick\u00e9 pro n\u011b<\/figcaption><\/figure><p>\u00a0<\/p><p>Oba typy polyetylenu jsou vyr\u00e1b\u011bny ve form\u011b pelet, kter\u00e9 jsou pak d\u00e1le zpracov\u00e1v\u00e1ny do podoby film\u016f nebo trubek. Jejich hustota se konven\u010dn\u011b m\u011b\u0159\u00ed metodou hustotn\u00edho gradientu nebo ultrazvuku, ale tyto techniky vy\u017eaduj\u00ed PE v jeho \u010dist\u00e9 podob\u011b, co\u017e m\u016f\u017ee b\u00fdt nap\u0159. v p\u0159\u00edpad\u011b film\u016f probl\u00e9m. Proto je vhodn\u00e9 tradi\u010dn\u00ed metody kombinovat s Ramanovou spektroskopi\u00ed &#8211; s mikroskopem <a href=\"https:\/\/nicoletcz.cz\/produkt\/dxr3-mikroskop\/\">Nicolet DXR3<\/a> nebo <a href=\"https:\/\/nicoletcz.cz\/produkt\/dxr3xi-mikroskop\/\">DXR3xi<\/a>.<\/p><p>Pomoc\u00ed t\u00e9 je mo\u017en\u00e9 nejen ur\u010dit chemick\u00e9 slo\u017een\u00ed analyzovan\u00e9 l\u00e1tky, ale tak\u00e9 stanovit jej\u00ed koncentraci, pop\u0159. konforma\u010dn\u00ed zm\u011bny, zm\u011bny ve vazb\u00e1ch a dal\u0161\u00ed parametry, kter\u00e9 mohou usnadnit a zefektivnit v\u00fdrobu. Nav\u00edc, s\u00a0programem <strong>TQ Analyst<\/strong> lze tvo\u0159it metody, pomoc\u00ed kter\u00fdch je mo\u017en\u00e9 snadno a rychle odli\u0161it jednotliv\u00e9 typy PE.<\/p><figure id=\"attachment_9200\" aria-describedby=\"caption-attachment-9200\" style=\"width: 450px\" class=\"wp-caption aligncenter\"><img decoding=\"async\" class=\"wp-image-9200\" src=\"https:\/\/nicoletcz.cz\/app\/uploads\/2021\/10\/0f707bca-1-300x256.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"450\" height=\"384\" srcset=\"https:\/\/nicoletcz.cz\/app\/uploads\/2021\/10\/0f707bca-1-300x256.png 300w, https:\/\/nicoletcz.cz\/app\/uploads\/2021\/10\/0f707bca-1-768x655.png 768w, https:\/\/nicoletcz.cz\/app\/uploads\/2021\/10\/0f707bca-1.png 881w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 450px) 100vw, 450px\" \/><figcaption id=\"caption-attachment-9200\" class=\"wp-caption-text\">Program TQ Analyst: Graf diskriminantn\u00ed anal\u00fdzy, kter\u00fd zn\u00e1zor\u0148uje rozd\u011blen\u00ed jednotiv\u00fdch typ\u016f PE na z\u00e1klad\u011b spektr\u00e1ln\u00edch vlastnost\u00ed<\/figcaption><\/figure><p>\u00a0<\/p>                    <\/div>\n\t\t        \n                    <div id=\"ramanova-spektroskopie-tab\" class=\"clearfix eael-tab-content-item inactive\" data-title-link=\"ramanova-spektroskopie-tab\">\n\t\t\t\t        <style>@media(max-width:1024px){.elementor-4972 .elementor-element.elementor-element-8179397 .dce-post-item{padding:0px 0px 20px 0px;}}@media(max-width:767px){.elementor-4972 .elementor-element.elementor-element-8179397 .dce-post-item{padding:0px 0px 15px 0px;}}<\/style>\t\t<div data-elementor-type=\"section\" data-elementor-id=\"4972\" class=\"elementor elementor-4972\" data-elementor-post-type=\"elementor_library\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<section class=\"elementor-section elementor-top-section elementor-element elementor-element-aa1571b elementor-section-boxed elementor-section-height-default elementor-section-height-default\" data-id=\"aa1571b\" data-element_type=\"section\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-container elementor-column-gap-no\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-column elementor-col-100 elementor-top-column elementor-element elementor-element-4f9ab22\" data-id=\"4f9ab22\" data-element_type=\"column\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-wrap elementor-element-populated\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"dce-fix-background-loop elementor-element elementor-element-8179397 templatemode-yes elementor-widget elementor-widget-dyncontel-acfposts\" data-id=\"8179397\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"dyncontel-acfposts.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"acfposts-grid dce-posts-wrap simple-style\" data-style=\"simple\">\n\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t<div data-dce-post-id=\"1449\" class=\"dce-post-item dce-post-item-1449 dce-elementor-1449 column-  \">\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"dce-wrapper \">\n\n\t\